---
import InnerLayout from '../../layouts/InnerLayout.astro';
---

<InnerLayout
  title="Smart Living | EVO"
  description="EVO Smart Living connects lighting, climate, access, audio and automation into simple, elegant control experiences."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <div class="page-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">SMART LIVING</p>
        <h1>Intelligence that feels <span class="green-accent">natural.</span></h1>
        <p>Bring lighting, climate, access, audio and everyday scenes into one connected experience designed around the way people actually live.</p>
        <div class="page-hero-actions"><a class="page-button page-button-primary" href="/contact">Plan a Smart Space ↗</a><a class="page-button page-button-secondary" href="/solutions">Back to Solutions</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="page-hero-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="page-orb"></div><img src="/solutions/solution-smart-living.png" alt="" /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container page-section-inner">
      <div class="page-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONNECTED SPACES</p><h2>Designed around people, <span class="green-accent">not complexity.</span></h2></div><p>A smart space should feel simpler to use, not more technical. EVO focuses on practical control, clear scenes and systems that disappear into everyday life.</p></div>
      <div class="card-grid-4">
        <article class="content-card"><span>01</span><h3>Lighting &amp; Scenes</h3><p>Create repeatable moods and practical scenes for daily routines, entertaining and energy use.</p></article>
        <article class="content-card"><span>02</span><h3>Climate &amp; Comfort</h3><p>Coordinate compatible comfort systems around occupancy, schedules and real use.</p></article>
        <article class="content-card"><span>03</span><h3>Access &amp; Security</h3><p>Bring selected entry, monitoring and notification functions into one experience.</p></article>
        <article class="content-card"><span>04</span><h3>Audio &amp; Integration</h3><p>Connect room audio and supported systems without turning the space into a control room.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="split-section">
    <div class="container split-inner">
      <div class="split-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="page-orb"></div><img src="/solutions/solution-smart-living.png" alt="" /></div>
      <div class="split-copy"><p class="eyebrow">ONE EXPERIENCE</p><h2>Control that stays <span class="green-accent">clear.</span></h2><p>The goal is not to fill a home or building with gadgets. It is to make the systems behind the space easier to control, automate and adjust as life changes.</p><div class="feature-list"><article><span>01</span><strong>Room-Level Control</strong><p>Keep everyday actions simple and close to the user.</p></article><article><span>02</span><strong>Scenes &amp; Scheduling</strong><p>Group repeated actions into clear, predictable experiences.</p></article><article><span>03</span><strong>Mobile &amp; Touch Control</strong><p>Use supported interfaces without relying on one method only.</p></article><article><span>04</span><strong>Future Integration</strong><p>Leave room for new devices, services and automation logic.</p></article></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band"><div class="container cta-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">SMARTER EVERYDAY LIVING</p><h2>Plan the experience <span class="green-accent">before the devices.</span></h2><p>Tell EVO how the space should feel and work. The technical system can follow from there.</p></div><a class="page-button page-button-primary" href="/contact">Talk to EVO ↗</a></div></section>
</InnerLayout>
